# Machine-local paths only. Copy this file to .env; never commit .env.
#
# ONE path variable: REAL2SIM_INPUTS_ROOT. Every machine-local input (OpenPI
# checkpoints, 3DGS scenes, external table-collision bundles) lives under it
# in this layout, and the checked-in profiles / artifacts/manifest.yaml reach
# each one through the {inputs_root} template field (docs/configuration.md
# "inputs root"):
#
#   $REAL2SIM_INPUTS_ROOT/
#   ├── checkpoints/<name>/         policy.checkpoint: "{inputs_root}/checkpoints/<name>"
#   │     pi05_cup/                  (the checkpoint of both release profiles)
#   ├── scenes/<scene>/             scenes[].path: "{inputs_root}/scenes/<scene>"
#   │     flat_a_room/               (for example the environment check's scene;
#   │                                 the directory name is not the scene tag franka_flat)
#   └── registered-world/<bundle>/  not used by the release profiles; a scene's
#                                   background.json may name
#                                   "${REAL2SIM_INPUTS_ROOT}/registered-world/<bundle>/coacd"
#
# The value must be ABSOLUTE (no ~, no relative path) and must not be a
# symlink: scene manifests expand ${REAL2SIM_INPUTS_ROOT} in several separate
# processes, and artifact verification compares exact paths. The repository
# default is <repo>/local-inputs (git-ignored); the release installer,
# real2sim-download-release --profile <profile>, writes this line for you.
#
# FR3 CUP/PLATE
# (config/release/fr3/flat/a_room_cup_cup1trim.yaml)
# 1. Replace the /ABSOLUTE/PATH value below.
# 2. Validate before running:
#      .venv/bin/real2sim-run \
#        --config config/release/fr3/flat/a_room_cup_cup1trim.yaml \
#        --check-runtime
REAL2SIM_INPUTS_ROOT=/ABSOLUTE/PATH/TO/local-inputs

# Set this only when CUDA 12.8 is not installed at /usr/local/cuda-12.8 and
# nvcc is not already on PATH.
# CUDA_HOME=/ABSOLUTE/PATH/TO/cuda-12.8

# Optional default LeRobot episode parquet for --policy-image-source lerobot.
# REAL2SIM_POLICY_EPISODE=/ABSOLUTE/PATH/TO/episode_000000.parquet

# OPENPI_DATA_HOME=runtime-cache/openpi
